# W4 memory family waivers (rationale: docs/coverage/W4_MEMORY.md)
# MEMCH wrappers (20 protocols): structural constant bits
#   addr[16:14] / addr_full[16:14]  - ROWW=14 < AW=17, tied 0
#   dqs[1:0] (+ dqs port line)      - tied Hi-Z in educational MEMCORE
#   trace_cmd[2]                    - only codes 1..3 exist
#   haddr[8], trace_addr[8]         - NCH=1: sel must be 0 (BUG-MEMCH-1)
#   ca[7:6] (LPDDR6/7), ca[6] (LPDDR5/5X) - constant-0 CA padding
# DFI: init_cnt[7:5], lp_cnt[1], unused; dead default arms; if-attribution
